        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova, Kufumbwa muntu uusyaala mumonya mumunzi uyoojazigwa ipanga apamba abulwazi, pele oyo uuinka kuliba-Kasidi uyoopona, uyoovuba buumi bwakwe akupona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
