        {
          "text": "Lino basilutwe bakaambila mwami kuti, Oyu muntu ajayigwe, nkaambo mukwaamba majwi aali obo ulatyompya maanza aabasilumamba bacisyeede omuno mumunzi amaanza aabantu boonse. Oyu muntu tayandi kuletela bantu aba coolwe pe, ulayanda kubaletela mapenzi buyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
