        {
          "text": "Lino bakajata Jeremiya, bamuwaala mumulindi wa-Malikiya mwana wamwami uuli mulubuwa lwabalindizi. Bamuselusya Jeremiya antambo, nkabela omo mumulindi kamutakwe maanzi, kamuli intimba buyo, aboobo Jeremiya wakabbila mukati kantimba.",
