        {
          "text": "Elyo Ebedi-meleki mu-Kusi, umwi muzibe wamuŋanda yamwami, naakamvwa kuti balibikide Jeremiya omo mumulindi, (mwami wakalikede mumulyango wa-Benjamini), ",
