        {
          "text": "Mpawo mwami Zedekiya wakakonkezya kuli-Jeremiya cakusisikizya kuti, Jehova mbwali muumi, ngonguwe iwakalenga myuuya yesu, ncobeni nsikooyookujaya, alimwi nsikooyookwaaba mumaanza aabantu aba bayanda kukujaya.",
