        },
        {
          "text": "Mpoonya awo Jeremiya wakaambila Zedekiya kuti, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova Leza wamakamu Leza wa-Israyeli. Ncobeni na ulazumina kwiinka kuyoolyaaba mumaanza aabasilutwe bamwami wa-Babuloni, buumi bwako tabukooyoosweka, amunzi uno tuukooyootentwa mumulilo, aboobo uyoopona, webo aluzubo lwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
