            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakabena banakazi boonse bacisyeede muŋanda yamwami wa-Juda, bakali mukutolwa kulibasilutwe bamwami wa-Babuloni, nkabela bakali kwaamba kuti, Ma! Bazolwani bako bakweena, bakukoma! Maulu aako mbwaabbila mukati kantimba, bakulekelezya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.38.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
