              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ncobeni basilutwe boonse bakeza kuli-Jeremiya, bamubuzya makani. Nkabela wakabavwiila mbubonya mbuli mwami mbwaakamulailila. Lino bakaumuna, bamuleka buyo, nkaambo makani taakwe naakamvwigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.38.27",
